{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome! It\u2019s a pleasure to have you with us! May I offer you a look at today's specialty?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udccb \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 CHEF'S DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dish contains no allergens, but <i>might include</i> Streets Of Rage-like action in a classic GTA-style city with Overcooked / Dave The Diver inspired cooking &amp; time management minigames! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2754 APPETIZERS - WHAT IT'S ALL ABOUT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1b <strong>Fight First, Feed Later</strong> \u2013 Fight the hangry, then win them over with food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf45 <strong>Tasty Exploration</strong> \u2013 Explore and take sidequests for cash &amp; new ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude20 <strong>High Stakes</strong> \u2013 Mess up a meal, and the punks are back on the streets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9a <strong>Pimp Your Ride</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your truck into a flavor-packed peace machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Edible Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Hot sauce sprays. Stamina stews. You name it, you craft it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf72 <strong>Taste the World</strong> \u2013 Unlock global recipes: pasta, stir-fry, pierogi, tacos, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd4b 1ST COURSE - FIGHTING\u00a0  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/8ec1065bfcb597676584022b5525aa24.poster.avif?t=1772725289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/8ec1065bfcb597676584022b5525aa24.webm?t=1772725289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/8ec1065bfcb597676584022b5525aa24.mp4?t=1772725289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each district starts with calming the troublemakers with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Lightning Counters</strong> \u2013 Turn a punch into your enemy\u2019s downfall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaa <strong>Juggling</strong> \u2013 Launch foes skyward and combo them mid-air.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Targeted Throws</strong> \u2013 Grab and slam opponents where you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Special Moves</strong> \u2013 Fill your meter and unleash devastation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 <strong>Pickups</strong> \u2013 Boost combos with crates, tires, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd3 <strong>Wall-Bouncing</strong> \u2013 Smash enemies pinball-style off the walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Cooking Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Craft weapons of mass nutrition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2a MAIN COURSE - COOKING + CRAFTING </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/871379deeea01464c82dd4742c0872f0.poster.avif?t=1772725289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/871379deeea01464c82dd4742c0872f0.webm?t=1772725289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/871379deeea01464c82dd4742c0872f0.mp4?t=1772725289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the troublemakers are calmed, it\u2019s time to feed them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Kitchen Manager</strong> \u2013 Rearrange your setup for smoother cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Menu Mastery</strong> \u2013 Create dishes &amp; guess the townsfolk\u2019s tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Grill Master</strong> \u2013 Set up your station just how you like it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u23f0 <strong>Time &amp; Resources</strong> \u2013 Stock smart, toss waste fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Wild Minigames</strong> \u2013 Battle ingredients &amp; face crazy twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83e\udd57 <strong>Enrich Your Kitchen</strong> \u2013 Add fresh ingredients &amp; recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udd27 <strong>Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Get better gear to serve faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u2697\ufe0f <strong>Culinary Crafting</strong> \u2013 Experiment to unlock killer recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\ude9a <strong>Pimp Your Ride</strong> \u2013 Make your food truck scream \u201cSpicy!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 CRANK THE OVEN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The dishes won\u2019t run out anytime soon (hey, they\u2019re digital!), but we recommend adding us to your WISHLIST so the chef keeps cooking non-stop.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976200?t=1772725289","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/1524071095940137cdc93674c6cd7e03aa45a23d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772725289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste